flowchart TD
    A[模糊需求] --> B{需要深度探索?}
    B -->|是| C[openspec-explore 或 brainstorming]
    B -->|否| D[openspec-propose]
    C --> D
    D --> E[proposal + design + specs + tasks.md]
    E --> F{tasks 够细?}
    F -->|小改动| G[openspec-apply 直接做]
    F -->|复杂/跨模块| H[writing-plans 展开 tasks]
    H --> I[git worktree 隔离]
    I --> J[executing-plans / subagent-driven]
    G --> K[verification-before-completion]
    J --> K
    K --> L[openspec-verify]
    L --> M[openspec-archive]
